        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horror game about a blogger who uncovers the truth behind urban legends.</strong> <br>The first story takes place in an eerie shopping mall, where the protagonist takes a job as a night security guard to investigate a chilling rumor: every year, on this very night, guards mysteriously vanish without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0021cca3c7950ce062c90b275d6fc792.poster.avif?t=1781870540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0021cca3c7950ce062c90b275d6fc792.webm?t=1781870540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the past is never truly buried… Long ago, a circus stood here. It burned down in a terrible fire, claiming many lives. Now, the shadows of that tragedy seem to linger within the mall’s walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0d76ba6d919d828f1f1793fbdec45ae6.poster.avif?t=1781870540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0d76ba6d919d828f1f1793fbdec45ae6.webm?t=1781870540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to gather clues, uncover the story of the fire, and discover <strong>why the circus became a cursed place—and who really perished that night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st